            {
                "entry_id": "4be2e9c6-f87e-3cf9-8495-8323c154d4bc",
                "word": "survol",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "a60e2b5b-6f87-4d84-a409-8614f6903df2",
                        "entry_id": "4be2e9c6-f87e-3cf9-8495-8323c154d4bc",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "survols"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d42df72c-9a24-3908-9466-783b7dc41d2d",
                        "entry_id": "4be2e9c6-f87e-3cf9-8495-8323c154d4bc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Action de voler au-dessus d'un endroit."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5432940b-18fa-4986-ac91-c1e4fc7dc528",
                                "sense_id": "d42df72c-9a24-3908-9466-783b7dc41d2d",
                                "text": "«Le ministère des Affaires étrangères de la République de Bulgarie (...) n’a pas donné l’autorisation diplomatique pour le survol du territoire bulgare pour les avions russes», a indiqué la diplomatie bulgare dans un communiqué, défendant une décision «conforme au régime des sanctions de l’UE contre la Russie»."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "cd19cd13-41b3-3f39-81bb-636bcd7f0832",
                        "entry_id": "4be2e9c6-f87e-3cf9-8495-8323c154d4bc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Passage d'un engin spatial à proximité d'un astre sans capture par ce dernier."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "especially"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "22d66fde-8033-3393-b8fc-29800d8b05c5",
                        "entry_id": "4be2e9c6-f87e-3cf9-8495-8323c154d4bc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Regard rapide et superficiel sur un sujet."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "fa2cfc9d-61f7-4da2-bbed-5755725fe436",
                                "sense_id": "22d66fde-8033-3393-b8fc-29800d8b05c5",
                                "text": "La jeunesse connaît ces privilèges : Qui saurait la confondre ? L'expérience, cette béquille pour éclopés de la vie, ne vient point alourdir le survol de ses certitudes."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0e786c91-6f9b-31b1-8f6d-a048f4c2a2c5",
                        "entry_id": "4be2e9c6-f87e-3cf9-8495-8323c154d4bc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Exploration rapide sur écran, sans possibilité de modification, du contenu d’une mémoire."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d9bb6681-5efc-47a3-bcd1-7de79d15fec9",
                        "source_entry_id": "4be2e9c6-f87e-3cf9-8495-8323c154d4bc",
                        "target_lang_word": "flyby",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "flyby",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3586bc91-eaa0-3f9f-abd8-c6b0fe7217d0",
                                        "entry_id": "2ff17217-9eac-3ce1-b2c6-c626b6e130da",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A flight past a celestial object in order to make observations."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fee48ccc-2344-423e-a1d1-efe7a77262e7",
                                                "sense_id": "3586bc91-eaa0-3f9f-abd8-c6b0fe7217d0",
                                                "text": "The upcoming flyby of Halley's comet is expected to provide new information on the nature of the comet."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9b7fc93f-718b-4f99-a534-5e4cb8b28ba9",
                                                "sense_id": "3586bc91-eaa0-3f9f-abd8-c6b0fe7217d0",
                                                "text": "Farthest from the dim red dwarf Ondeste, the ice dwarf Maisuth has attracted no interest beyond a cursory flyby by automated probe in 1874. No significant resources were noted."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f3b9d4f5-e5ec-366d-9434-0817dc50b89f",
                                        "entry_id": "2ff17217-9eac-3ce1-b2c6-c626b6e130da",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A low-level ceremonial flight, typically in connection with an airshow or a military parade."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fed7f2a1-5dff-4847-b59c-7f22eb710dfc",
                                                "sense_id": "f3b9d4f5-e5ec-366d-9434-0817dc50b89f",
                                                "text": "Two of your snot-nose jockeys did a fly-by on my tower at over 400 knots!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3e38418b-35b7-3f6d-b413-c49b48bf042c",
                                        "entry_id": "2ff17217-9eac-3ce1-b2c6-c626b6e130da",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A brief visit."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "49821deb-bf29-3e25-bd6b-f99f9f3bea6e",
                                        "entry_id": "2ff17217-9eac-3ce1-b2c6-c626b6e130da",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A sailby performed by a hydrofoil vessel while hydrofoiling."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fa8a68a8-e0c0-3f30-bb79-8d12dba2d3a7",
                                        "entry_id": "2ff17217-9eac-3ce1-b2c6-c626b6e130da",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A three-dimensional animated sequence in which the camera moves past an object or scenery."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8dfa7890-4f22-4112-94d4-b8a9431ad006",
                        "source_entry_id": "4be2e9c6-f87e-3cf9-8495-8323c154d4bc",
